# brinely.info is built by Vercel at the domain root (`npm run build:vercel`). No key is committed here.
# Vercel Production builds (VERCEL_ENV=production) must use the production project: set VITE_SUPABASE_URL
# (https://tuttbvwnlndcstmmxybb.supabase.co) and its publishable VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY in Vercel's Production
# environment. Preview builds use the staging URL below and the staging publishable key from Vercel's Preview
# environment. The staging Vercel project (`brinely-staging`, production branch `staging`) sets
# BRINELY_TARGET=staging and the staging key in its Production environment, so it uses the URL below.
# Process variables override this file. Never use a secret key.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://iclrvvsiwypxlwrwgqia.supabase.co
VITE_BASE=/
